{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2022-11-10 09:05:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS ANNOUNCES COMPLETION OF PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ELIMINATION OF CLASS B COMMON STOCK', 'text': "VICTOR, N.Y., NOV. 10, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CONSTELLATION BRANDS (NYSE: STZ), A LEADING BEVERAGE ALCOHOL COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT COMPLETED THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED RECLASSIFICATION TRANSACTION AND ELIMINATED ITS CLASS B COMMON STOCK. TRADING IN THE CLASS B COMMON STOCK WILL CEASE AFTER THE MARKETS CLOSE TODAY, AT WHICH TIME CONSTELLATION'S PUBLICLY LISTED STOCK WILL CONSIST SOLELY OF CLASS A COMMON STOCK."}